# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RAW CLIENT PHOTOS — deliberately excluded, do not remove this rule.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The originals in "Trystan Photos/" are full-resolution
# 4032px HEIC files straight off Trystan's phone. IMG_7034.heic contains a legible
# carrier shipping label (barcode, routing block, address text) belonging to a real
# customer. Committing these publishes that to the open internet and bakes it into
# git history, where removing it later means a history rewrite.
#
# The PROCESSED, downscaled, cropped WebP files that the site actually serves live in
# public/photos/ and ARE committed — but only after the IMG_7034 label region is
# cropped out during Phase 1 processing. See seo/PHOTO-INVENTORY.md §3.
#
# If this repo is ever made private, this rule can be revisited.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Trystan Photos/

# Stock photo ORIGINALS (snow placeholders) — same treatment as the job originals: the
# processed, downscaled files in public/photos/ are what ships. Sources + licenses are
# recorded in seo/PHOTO-INVENTORY.md section 7.
Stock Photos/

